Description:

JMAP Email/get, Email/parse and SearchSnippet/get follow RFC 8621 more
closely.  maxBodyValueBytes accepts 0, an unknown charset sets
isEncodingProblem, group names are decoded, asMessageIds is null for a
header that isn't a list of message ids, and unknown bodyProperties are
invalidArguments.  Email/parse returns null metadata, and SearchSnippet
previews stay within 255 octets.


Documentation:

RFC 8621 sections 4.1, 4.2, 4.9 and 5.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients requesting the imageSize or isDeleted body properties must
include https://cyrusimap.org/ns/jmap/mail in using.


GitHub issue:

None.
